{"agency_id": "network-for-learning", "canonical_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/did-you-get-the-memo-support-hub-has-arrived/#comment-291", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:43:22+00:00", "content": "Comment on Did you get the memo? Support Hub has arrived… by Shaun\n\nEverything is very open with a clear clarification of the challenges.\nIt was really informative. Your website is extremely helpful.\nThank you for sharing!", "content_hash": "57f264f3b7edca4fa74ae56b805d8f9223cbf3707bc9a4cd6e21836d77e95bf7", "cross_source_ids": {"source_id": "network-for-learning-rss-9a714e3d"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_rss_feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2018-05-19T22:47:03+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\rss\\2018-05\\742a8648df1b5bf57eaa4068.json", "record_id": "rss:742a8648df1b5bf57eaa4068", "source_account": "https://www.n4l.co.nz", "source_kind": "rss_feed", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/comments/feed/"}
{"agency_id": "te-wananga-o-raukawa", "canonical_url": "https://www.wananga.com/news/35/view", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:43:55+00:00", "content": "Learn te reo online with Huia Te Reo\n\nPoupou Huia Te Reo 1 We are now taking enrolments for a February start! Take up the Poupou Huia Te Reo challenge! Learn the Māori language online in the comfort of your own home, at a time that suits you with access to resources any time or place with Poupou Huia te Reo.  Follow the daily activities of a real whānau through a series of audio lessons and carry out fun online activities to reinforce your learnings. Learn te reo Māori online FREE  for NZ residents NZQA approved at Level 4 Beginners to Intermediate Starts Feb 22 | 20 weeks | Apply online Poupou Huia Te Reo 2: Te Hōkairangi If you enjoyed Poupou Huia Te Reo 1, be inspired as we continue our journey following the daily activities of a new whānau. Take a closer look at the beauty and skill of the reo with Poupou Huia te Reo - Te Hōkairangi and progress your level of the Māori language from beginners to conversational. Learn online in your own time, at a location that suits you, with others.  Advance your te reo online FREE for NZ residents NZQA approved at Level 5 Advanced beginners to Intermediate Starts Feb 22 | 20 weeks | Apply online", "content_hash": "929ae0913ec38fc842a29f0a77082d589a1dab3425031fad6c84c53986a150a9", "cross_source_ids": {"source_id": "te-wananga-o-raukawa-rss-19f03134"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_rss_feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2018-05-27T12:00:00Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\rss\\2018-05\\de93b2c45bb5432003f11daf.json", "record_id": "rss:de93b2c45bb5432003f11daf", "source_account": "https://www.wananga.com", "source_kind": "rss_feed", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.wananga.com/feed/atom"}
